{
 "A fintech in Lagos gives four product teams one model endpoint through a proxy. Apps ask for names like chat-fast; the proxy decides which real model that means.": "a54a38e03b.mp3",
 "At nine, the provider retires a model. The platform team points the alias at its successor, and no app is touched.": "195bdb2672.mp3",
 "With the model name compiled into the apps, two teams are down for hours waiting for new builds.": "27d77df29f.mp3",
